  "implementations": [
    "Original ChaCha20 64-bit counter/64-bit stream layout matching rand_chacha 0.10.0, including odd u32 positions",
    "Goldilocks standard uniform rejection and stable GPU tile-count/prefix/scatter compaction matching p3-goldilocks 0.6.1",
    "Owned source-RNG import and shared DeviceRandom cursor; cloning a device handle never replays its stream",
    "Opaque RandomWords stay session-bound and feed main/cubic lookup/quotient hiding inputs without host sample staging",
    "Combined output and bounded scratch admission before draws; explicit exhaustion/rejection errors and shared poisoning after execution failure",
    "Device keys, raw candidates, counters and generated samples scrub and drain before release; explicit seed upload staging copies are cleared",
    "Metal explicitly rejects this implementation; no CPU sampling fallback or public preprocessing promotion exists"
  ],
